      "id": "17913957987448084",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-02T04:09:35+01:00",
      "caption": "I’ve been hella bummed about not being able to do my usual weekly UNCUT entries because I just don’t have the mental capacity for them at the moment. (It’s been about three months since my last recording.) Even when it comes to physically building products for PoG, I haven’t been able to do much lately.\n\nMy energy has been going into job hunting—trying to land a corporate 9–5 role to bring some financial stability back into my life. The last time I worked in corporate was in 2020. Since then, it’s been freelancing and odd jobs here and there. Right now, I’m working part-time at Everyman Cinema to make ends meet.\n\nBut yeah… building a fashion brand ain’t sexy. Building a business ain’t sexy either, for that matter.\n\nCan’t be a starving artist with a mind full of gold. Sometimes you’ve got to play the game of life.\n\nI guess the new format of UNCUT will be these snapshots of whatever phase of life I’m currently in.\n\nBuilding @pioneersofgreatness\n\nGreatest,\nGALANA©CI",
