      "timestamp": "2026-08-31T04:26:18+01:00",
      "caption": "What do you do when life hits you from all angles? When shit ain’t going your way? \n\nYou ride that shit out.\n\nThis ain’t a sprint. It’s a marathon.\n\nA 12-round fight… Fuck it. A 15-rounder.\n\nStay in the fight long enough to see the results. Long enough to outlast the bullshit life throws at you.\n\nWhen I’m not building PoG, I’m building the mind and body capable of building it.\n\nBuilding @pioneersofgreatness \n\nGreatest, \nGALANA©CI",
