    {
      "id": "18162576001454093",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-23T04:40:35+01:00",
      "caption": "The way I can trace these designs pre-AI times is mad. Just goes to show ideas do not have an end date. It’s down to you whether you’d like to keep them alive or not.\n\nBuilding @pioneersofgreatness \n\nGreatest, \nGALANA©CI\n\nK2G emblem short for “KEYS 2 GREATNESS” originated from the very first graphic tee I designed for my previous brand.\n\nThe OG “GREATNESS” graphic tee back in 2021. This may or may not make a comeback 🤔\n\nTaking home my new toy aka da 3D printer. Shout out to @ebenbuilds for hooking me up 🙌\n\n@cookieandorea nosey one \n\nAll set up in da home studio!\n\nCan’t even spell ACRONYM properly 😂\n\nCalibrating the 3D printer by doing some test prints.\n\nThe way I wanted to get a 3D printer 5 years ago but never pulled the trigger but at least we here now!\n\nGetting the hang of calibrating the printer.\n\nJust blows my mind that it’s only now that I got my hands on a 3D printer.\n\nObsessed…\n\nI said I won’t have any visible branding on PoG but now seeing these at hand I may just make an exception because holy shit 🤩",
