    {
      "id": "17948664540011358",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-06T04:38:00+01:00",
      "caption": "To me, great designers don’t just build great products. They build a language so they can write poetry.\n\nThat’s how I’m approaching the development of PoG.\n\nI’m creating a design language that doesn’t rely on logos, but instead on form, function, construction, materiality, scale, abstraction, and subtraction. The goal is for every product to speak the same language, regardless of category, material, or silhouette.\n\nBuilding @pioneersofgreatness \n\nGreatest, \nGALANA©CI",
