    {
      "id": "17970277842045301",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-11T20:11:12+01:00",
      "caption": "This shit took longer than expected. \n\nHad to pattern grade the FORGE DENIM JACKET base sample that I had which was a size small to a large before even starting sewing (first time ever doing so!)\n\nThis was also a custom made to order for my good friend and he hand picked the denim himself so it’s a lighter denim (10z instead of the usual 14oz with a bleached wash) and he also wanted the collar to be shortened.\n\nI’ve always told myself I wanted to master denim and have it as a foundational brand identity for the brand because of its working class roots which ties into the origins of boxing.\n\nTime to develop some new products now!\n\nBuilding @pioneersofgreatness \n\nGreatest, \n#GALANACCI",
